    "created_at": "2016-03-13T12:08:50Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-03-13T12:08:50Z",
    "body": "It'd be nice if as many URLs possible have this behaviour, and that the current behavior is the exception where required for legacy. Otherwise the current behaviour will probably remain the default in bindings generators, and be very likely to spread to many new contexts by accident.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
